    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.5
  m_Text: '<b>Neocortex''s group chat feature, where characters or the player can
    join or leave dynamically.</b>


    <b><color=#F59E0B>01</color></b> Set up
    the characters on the NeocortexSmartAgent components.

    <b><color=#F59E0B>02</color></b>
    Use the toggles at the top of the screen to make characters join or leave.

    <b><color=#F59E0B>03</color></b>
    In this demo, joining or leaving triggers the next conversation round.

    <b><color=#F59E0B>04</color></b>
    Speak to the group to trigger another conversation round.

'
